[{"title":"送羽林领军陛见三首 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"多君此去气何豪，马上霜花拂锦袍。\n旌旆兼程天路近，风云发轫汉坛高。\n相将竹帛分龙节，怀抱经纶讲豹韬。\n大笑山中老铅椠，腰间不识吕虔刀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49989,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送羽林领军陛见三首 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"出身便作羽林儿，换取朝衣拜凤墀。\n脱颖囊锥看此日，拔茅连茹正当时。\n雪晴古驿高歌入，霜发新硎望气知。\n想到南衙多胜事，御河冰泮问归期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49990,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠何丈人","author":"成鹫","text":"曾向汾江识老人，朱颜白发映乌巾。\n三株柏子千年实，一点松膏万古春。\n太极仙侯绝祖武，公羊墨守足家珍。\n问年正是河清日，好向慈泉下钓纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49991,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送易州牧赵山公之官","author":"成鹫","text":"美人为政美人乡，手抱瑶琴到五羊。\n一路清风归易水，万方霖雨出天潢。\n箕裘奕世图麟阁，节钺专潘并雁行。\n王谢风流真不忝，隔桥吟咏笑相将。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49992,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏广文瀛洲偕张北山过大通见赠赋答","author":"成鹫","text":"林下何人共入林，宗雷乘兴许相寻。\n当机慧业苏张辨，出袖清风李杜吟。\n花时恰好花边坐，世谊难忘世外心。\n借得青毡覆羌被，泮池珠水一般深。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49993,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苏瀛洲广文过寺话旧","author":"成鹫","text":"閒云野鹤一身轻，何似为儒早得名。\n官作模楷先十郡，手栽桃李遍三城。\n半生潦倒惭亲友，两世交游忆盛平。\n咫尺清风桥下水，依稀犹记踏歌声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49994,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"熊国博远庵入粤谒范中丞宿大通见赠赋答","author":"成鹫","text":"却因北阮知南阮，侧听嘤鸣比凤鸣。\n说项夙推熊国博，识韩今见郑康成。\n中丞世谊山兼重，御史家风水共清。\n一宿茅堂饭粗粝，问君曾否恕逢迎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49995,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦有怀姚明府时略地海上 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"竹里开门听早鸡，露华浓裛野棠低。\n美人为政容樗散，泽畔行吟信杖藜。\n彩鹢去时寒腊尽，白鸥宿处水云迷。\n分明记得重来约，净埽蓬蒿候马蹄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49996,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦有怀姚明府时略地海上 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"海阔波澄曙色新，昨宵何处守庚申。\n悬知激浊扬清者，不是浮家泛宅人。\n破浪乘风增壮志，普天率土尽阳春。\n凭君手策羲和驭，冻解冰消下钓纶。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49997,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦有怀姚明府时略地海上 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"翘首郎星媚远天，琴书同上米家船。\n挂帆夜渡横江雪，击楫晴分海市烟。\n村舍椒盘供献岁，田家鸡骨报丰年。\n诗情到处堪乘兴，为寄阳春及野禅。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49998,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"元旦有怀姚明府时略地海上 其四","author":"成鹫","text":"日射彤云接舳舻，摄提初转靖萑苻。\n定随飞舄朝双阙，岂效扁舟泛五湖。\n两岸新畬催布谷，隔江春鸟唤提壶。\n几年官舍清如水，似此元朝不可无。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":49999,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答梁南樵过寺见赠韵二首 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"一帆春雨一篙烟，门外何人泊画船。\n得句吟来欢喜地，随风飞上净居天。\n颠张狂李非关酒，瘦贾寒郊总是禅。\n江北江南无可问，待君携手问南泉。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50000,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"答梁南樵过寺见赠韵二首 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"春入空林澹也浓，野花开遍一重重。\n梦回老鹤啄寒磬，坐久驱乌鸣午钟。\n客至罢琴悬向壁，篱疏移竹补将松。\n因君过我闻清论，明月入怀云荡胸。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50001,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"呈贾青南鹾使 其一","author":"成鹫","text":"搴帷到处识簪裾，童稚争迎贾父车。\n裕国折衷盐铁论，匡时原委治安书。\n吟僧节底由冲马，钓叟竿头许辨鱼。\n闻道欲来兴法社，清池栽藕待蓝舆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50002,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"呈贾青南鹾使 其二","author":"成鹫","text":"东南凋弊仰屏翰，野老闻风快识韩。\n五马剖符辞海甸，双鱼飞札到江干。\n雷州细葛黄如蜜，琼琯奇香臭比兰。\n三复拜嘉还踧踖，负暄林下报书难。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50003,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"呈贾青南鹾使 其三","author":"成鹫","text":"隔水瞻云剌未通，旁人往往笑痴聋。\n心随飞絮还沾絮，兴逐南风又北风。\n借得奇文须卒业，留将经论契参同。\n春畦草色青如许，珍重刍荛待玉骢。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50004,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次高裕公邑佐韵","author":"成鹫","text":"野老经年不到城，夜来渐觉梦魂清。\n非关贫病逢迎懒，却恐疏狂礼数生。\n濠上自知鱼有乐，云边谁识鹤无情。\n吟君好句如相见，唯欠春风半日程。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50005,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过海城堂作","author":"成鹫","text":"依稀记得花时约，雨后开门见落花。\n咫尺断云迷浦溆，相将了棹入烟霞。\n海城旧业还三径，池馆春风自一家。\n借得閒房挂瓢笠，老僧从此有生涯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50006,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"谒刍庐阿阇黎影堂","author":"成鹫","text":"老梅逢春不当春，虚堂留影是何人。\n金刀枉作铅刀用，千担难消一担真。\n云顶道场裘守府，风中灯烛火传薪。\n眼前所见皆如此，珍重重来转法轮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50007,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽黄汪千","author":"成鹫","text":"曾从湖海识元龙，别后交情见澹浓。\n茗椀旗枪犹转战，酒泉茅土已移封。\n风流有恨遗羌笛，故旧频惊歇里舂。\n有约看花人不见，重来多恐失欢悰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50008,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠伍居之入学","author":"成鹫","text":"亲见郎君总角垂，斑衣释褐正当时。\n却怜之子成名早，莫怪而翁入社迟。\n鹤老卑栖无影树，风雏飞上最高枝。\n赠君不尽奚囊兴，待送公车更有诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50009,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"挽邓魏公","author":"成鹫","text":"摇落徒增楚客悲，西风吹折邓林枝。\n如何上国观光日，正是先生易箦时。\n入社久虚三岁约，探怀留得九秋诗。\n池花开后篱花发，惆怅溪头更待谁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50010,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题四供十六颂壁立石","author":"成鹫","text":"挺然直峙，中立不倚。\n晔晔紫芝，灵根崛起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50011,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"通方石","author":"成鹫","text":"涅而不缁，磨而不磷。\n虚中方外，贞比幽人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50012,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苍碧石","author":"成鹫","text":"赩如宝山，色类优昙。\n玉蕴于璞，青出于蓝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50013,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"玲珑石","author":"成鹫","text":"八面玲珑，四楞著地。\n何须点头，心空及第。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50014,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"水仙花","author":"成鹫","text":"山凡难弟，梅亦难兄。\n尘根清净，水石移情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50015,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"荼?花","author":"成鹫","text":"荆棘丛中，幽芳旖旎。\n甘露门开，闻薰随喜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50016,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"蘡薁花","author":"成鹫","text":"播种中秋，看花上巳。\n绿叶丹葩，孤标独异。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50017,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"虞姬花","author":"成鹫","text":"种出秣陵，名传垓下。\n青眼相看，素心自写。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50018,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"佛手柑","author":"成鹫","text":"示兜罗锦，耀光明拳。\n垂金色臂，佛果斯圆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50019,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菱角","author":"成鹫","text":"苇渡凌波，囊锥脱颖。\n净尽锋芒，具见体性。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50020,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"石榴","author":"成鹫","text":"明珠在腹，开口示人。\n和盘托出，自己家珍。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50021,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"波罗","author":"成鹫","text":"是岸非岸，即物离物。\n因地果生，为波罗蜜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50022,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"紫白茄","author":"成鹫","text":"紫岂夺朱，白可受采。\n并蒂连花，犍椎相会。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_3.csv","pointer":50023,"sha256":"dc0f9be95fde68d0587a89f7f11526c1b01ac96ad263e94221e979e35a2b94cc","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦瓜","author":"成鹫","text":"生不厌苦，熟不妨甜。\n生熟并用，取不伤廉。","collec